  "2026-09-29T16:02:05.306Z",codex,"Greptile review of c641931 found a valid body-grep defect: a source commit body quoting Release pm-context v... was selected as a release. A disposable Git regression failed before the fix; the decision now filters subjects only. Its fixture-remote objection did not reproduce locally, but the fixture now declares a self remote and the inconsistent-metadata assertion checks the actual diagnostic. New local release:check passed; independent c8 across eight authored TypeScript source files ran 283 tests and measured statements 3393/3393 (100%), branches 904/909 (99.44%), functions 91/91 (100%), lines 3393/3393 (100%). Five branch arms remain, so coverage is a merge blocker."
