  "https://github.com/unbraind/pm-context/pull/122",global,review candidate
body: "Resume the oldest untagged release commit after the latest merged tag. Select its immutable SHA and verify package, manifest, and lock versions before any new version is considered. Resume skips metadata mutation and protected PR creation, validates the prepared commit, restores notes from its committed changelog, then uses the existing attested npm publish, tag, and GitHub Release steps. Rollout is the reviewed workflow change only; rollback is reverting that workflow commit before a run. No production data migration."
